WEBVTT

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.536
Padre Morrisroe, ambae alikuja
kwenye jimbo hivi karibuni,

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:07.416
Joyce Bailey, binti wa miaka 17

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.520
na mimi kwenda kufuata vinywaji.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.240
Tulipofika mlangoni,

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:18.696
mwanaume mweupe alikua amesimama
njia ya mlango na bunduki,

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:23.200
na akasema, "Malaya
nitalipua ubongo wako!"

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:27.736
Na kabla hata sijajibu,

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.616
kabla hata sijaelewa
kinachoendelea,